Package: uzunyx-tasks
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: emi <285864120+antarest47@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: plasma-workspace (>= 4:6.7), plasma-desktop-data, qml6-module-org-kde-taskmanager, qml6-module-org-kde-pipewire, qml6-module-org-kde-plasma-workspace, qml6-module-org-kde-kcmutils, qml6-module-org-kde-notificationmanager, qml6-module-org-kde-plasma-plasma5support, qdbus-qt6, python3, python3-gi
Recommends: plasma-pa
Description: Task manager for the Plasma panel, in the Uzunyx style
 Plasma widget (org.uzunyx.tasks), written in QML only: glass buttons in the
 edition's accent colour for running apps, and a dot per window, up to three.
 .
 Clicking activates or minimizes a window; on a group it shows live
 thumbnails, with media and volume controls. Pinned apps can be dragged to
 reorder, and files dropped on a button open with that app.
